From 3688496e4638bbe80ddf1d26f0926a64bf5908bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jack Kingston <998656+jkingston@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:54:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(allwinner): complete A133 system suspend

Compose the reviewed SCP transaction with retained EL3 context and the
stock GIC/SoC restore sequence. Advertise PSCI SYSTEM_SUSPEND only after
runtime capability probing.

Assisted-by: LLM
